message: "If you use this artefact, please cite it using the metadata below (and the associated manuscript where applicable)."
title: "Resonatus Ontology: OWL 2 DL Model, SHACL Validation Profile, Optional Strict Profiles, and Verification Artefacts"
abstract: >
  Resonatus Ontology v1.1.0 research artefact: the frozen v1.0.0 OWL 2 DL core model and default
  SHACL profile, plus owner-approved optional Strict Linear and Strict Assessment profiles, a
  multidimensional validation-result schema, competency questions, worked examples, and reproducible
  formal-verification artefacts. Strict-profile conformance is not scientific validation. Split
  licensing applies; see LICENSE.md for the authoritative per-path licence mapping.
